Tabs — menyuni yuqorida tab ko‘rinishida chiqaradi.
<ul class="nav nav-tabs">
    <li class="active"><a href="#">Home</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">Menu 1</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">Menu 2</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">Menu 3</a></li>
</ul>
2. Pills
<ul class="nav nav-pills">
    <li class="active"><a href="#">Home</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">Menu 1</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">Menu 2</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">Menu 3</a></li>
</ul>
Tabs vs Pills
Tabs  → tab ko‘rinishidagi menu
Pills → tugmaga o‘xshash menu
3. Vertical Pills
nav-stacked → menu vertikal bo‘ladi.
<ul class="nav nav-pills nav-stacked">
    <li class="active"><a href="#">Home</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">Menu 1</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">Menu 2</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">Menu 3</a></li>
</ul>
4. Dropdown bilan

Tabs yoki Pills ichida dropdown ham bo‘lishi mumkin:
<ul class="nav nav-tabs">

    <li class="active"><a href="#">Home</a></li>

    <li class="dropdown">
        <a class="dropdown-toggle"
           data-toggle="dropdown"
           href="#">
            Menu 1 <span class="caret"></span>
        </a>

        <ul class="dropdown-menu">
            <li><a href="#">Submenu 1</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Submenu 2</a></li>
        </ul>
    </li>

</ul>
<ul class="nav nav-tabs">

    <li class="active"><a href="#">Home</a></li>

    <li class="dropdown">
        <a class="dropdown-toggle"
           data-toggle="dropdown"
           href="#">
            Menu 1 <span class="caret"></span>
        </a>

        <ul class="dropdown-menu">
            <li><a href="#">Submenu 1</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Submenu 2</a></li>
        </ul>
    </li>

</ul>
5. Justified

nav-justified → menu elementlarini teng kenglikda joylashtiradi.
<ul class="nav nav-tabs nav-justified">
    <li class="active"><a href="#">Home</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">Menu 1</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">Menu 2</a></li>
    <li><a href="#">Menu 3</a></li>
</ul>
//KEYWORD
→ Menu/navigation yaratish uchun ishlatiladi.

.nav → navigation
.nav-tabs → Tabs
.nav-pills → Pills
.active → tanlangan menu
.nav-stacked → vertikal Pills
.nav-justified → teng kenglikdagi menu
.dropdown → dropdown menu

data-toggle="tab" → dynamic Tabs
data-toggle="pill" → dynamic Pills
.tab-content → tab contentlari
.tab-pane → har bir content
.fade → animatsiya
.in → boshidan ochiq

Tabs → tab ko‘rinishi
Pills → button/pill ko‘rinishi
